{{!
    @template mod_thesesynthesis/dossier_filters

    Filtres des dossiers suivis : promotion, statut, texte. Les champs sont en ligne : le formulaire
    tient sur une ligne pour ne pas ajouter d'espace entre eux.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * action Adresse du formulaire.
    * cmid Module de l'activité de suivi.
    * promotions, statuses Contextes de mod_these/select.
    * search Texte recherché.
    * placeholder, filterlabel Libellés.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "action": "https://example.com/mod/thesesynthesis/view.php",
        "cmid": 2,
        "promotions": {"name": "cmid", "id": "menucmid", "class": "select custom-select custom-select mr-2 mb-1",
            "options": [{"value": "0", "label": "Toutes les promotions", "selected": true}]},
        "statuses": {"name": "status", "id": "menustatus", "class": "select custom-select custom-select mr-2 mb-1",
            "options": [{"value": "-999", "label": "Tous les statuts", "selected": true}]},
        "search": "",
        "placeholder": "Rechercher",
        "filterlabel": "Filtrer"
    }
}}
<form method="get" action="{{action}}" class="form-inline mb-3"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{cmid}}" />{{#promotions}}{{> mod_these/select}}{{/promotions}}{{#statuses}}{{> mod_these/select}}{{/statuses}}<input type="text" name="search" value="{{search}}" class="form-control mr-2 mb-1" placeholder="{{placeholder}}" /><button type="submit" class="btn btn-secondary mb-1">{{filterlabel}}</button></form>
